# Recordings of real imports: somebody else's page and your own traffic.
#
# Ignored by default for the same reason the fixtures are — but unlike a
# fixture, a transcript is worth committing in a private cookbook: a recorded
# import that went wrong is a regression test that stays red until it is
# fixed, and a test only one machine has is a test CI never runs. Add an
# exception for the ones you want kept, or delete this file to keep them all.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!_harness-selftest.json
!_harness-selftest.page.html
